  "id": "polypharmacy",
  "term": "polypharmacy",
  "definition": "Polypharmacy is the use of multiple medications as part of care, often in people with complex or hard-to-treat psychiatric disorders. In psychiatry, it may be important for management but can also increase the risk of harmful drug interactions, problems taking medicines as prescribed, and poorer health outcomes.",
